# Session 7–8: AI Exam Extraction — Build Plan

Here is the anchor document. It won't change during the build. Use it to track progress.

---

## Purpose (for the record)

Reduce the cost schools pay at cybercafés for typing exams. Every naira saved on typing is a naira not paid out of school operations.

---

## Architecture

```
Teacher/Admin uploads photo
        ↓
Vercel API route (POST /api/admin/exams/extract)
        ↓
OpenRouter (single VLM call — OCR + LaTeX + structuring)
        ↓
Structured JSON back to client
        ↓
Split-screen editor (image left, editable questions right)
        ↓
Save to Supabase (exam_papers + exam_questions)
        ↓
Print via pluggable ExamPaperTemplate
```

**Provider abstraction:** the VLM call is wrapped in `src/lib/ai/exam-extractor.ts` with a provider interface. Swapping OpenRouter → Google Vision + Gemini later means changing one file, not the pipeline.

