## Out of Scope (v1)

- Diagrams (deferred — flagged in the prompt to return "diagram" placeholder)
- Handwriting in messy cursive (best effort — the review step exists for this)
- Multiple templates (v1 ships one)
- Teacher access (admin only)
- Answer sheet auto-generation

